# TiamaT Project
# See: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore for syntax details

## 1. Build, Output & Data Directories
/output/*
/data/*
/projects/*
/env/*

## 2. Secrets & Local Runtime Config (generes a l'execution, propres a la machine)
/.env
/config.json
/training_config.json

## 3. Python Bytecode & C Extensions
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

## 4. Logs & Databases
*.log

## 5. Poids de modeles telecharges automatiquement a la racine (ex: yolo11n.pt)
*.pt

## 6. OS & System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
docs/.DS_Store

